  "body": "## Summary\n- bind the certificate to protected MATHFORGE and MATHSOLVE commits and exact provider blobs\n- independently replay all integer y with |y| <= 1,000,000, with x unrestricted\n- certify the twelve-pair result at MATHCERT Level 2 through the governed exact-certificate replay control\n- preserve the unrestricted problem as not certified\n\n## Validation\n- governed exact-certificate replay: pass\n- five RM-DIO-004 positive/mutation checks: pass\n- claim-ledger validation: pass\n- certificate coverage audit: pass\n- CI reachability audit and tests: pass\n\n## Claim boundary\nThis certifies only the finite y interval. It does not certify the unrestricted workshop problem or supply a global height bound.",
